      "story_id": 1,
      "headline": "Russian drone strikes Gala\u021bi apartment building; Romania expels Russian consul, NATO pledges to defend every inch of allied territory",
      "summary": "A Russian Geran-2 drone targeting Ukrainian port infrastructure veered into Romanian airspace on the night of May 28\u201329 and struck the roof of a ten-story residential building in Gala\u021bi \u2014 11 km from the Ukrainian border \u2014 injuring two people and forcing the evacuation of 70 residents. Romania's President Nicu\u0219or Dan convened an emergency National Defense Council, summoned the Russian ambassador, declared the Russian consul in Constan\u021ba persona non grata, requested accelerated NATO anti-drone deployments, and notified the UN Security Council. NATO Secretary-General Rutte condemned Russia's 'reckless behaviour' and pledged to 'defend every inch of allied territory,' while Russia denied responsibility and Putin suggested the drone may have been Ukrainian. The Romanian Armed Forces' acting commander confirmed F-16s were scrambled but had only four minutes from detection to impact.",
      "actors_involved": [
        "Romanian Armed Forces"
