      "summary": "The Gala\u021bi drone strike immediately became a domestic political battlefield. Former PM Marcel Ciolacu (PSD) condemned Russian aggression but attacked the Bolojan government's response as 'below any standard,' while also resurfacing a claim \u2014 confirmed by fugitive former MP Sebastian Ghi\u021b\u0103 \u2014 that Romania accepted a free German anti-drone system under his government that was subsequently returned. AUR leader George Simion condemned the 'attack' and called for the government's resignation but conspicuously avoided naming Russia as the aggressor, despite AUR having previously voted against legislation authorizing the armed forces to shoot down intruding drones. PNL publicly accused both Grindeanu (PSD) and Simion of 'anti-national' reactions and said their silence on Russia amounted to 'kneeling before Moscow.'",
